<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20974] gss: drop unused multi-round context negotiation</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20974</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Lustre clients always initiate GSS context negotiation with PTLRPC_GSS_PROC_INIT and an empty context handle, and the negotiation completes in a single round. PTLRPC_GSS_PROC_CONTINUE_INIT is never sent by any Lustre client, so the server-side support for multi-round negotiation, in the ptlrpc_gss module and in lsvcgssd, is dead code.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
